OL,3,GNEWSATeenage girl found in road with
OL,4,Acritical injuries
OL,5,
OL,6,FA teenage girl is in a critical
OL,7,Fcondition in hospital after she was
OL,8,Ffound lying on a road with serious head
OL,9,Fand chest injuries, police said.
OL,11,FThe 16-year-old was found near a bus
OL,12,Fstop on Rook's Nest Road in Wakefield
OL,13,Fat about 20:30 BST on Tuesday and taken
OL,14,Fto hospital, West Yorkshire Police
OL,15,Fsaid.
OL,17,FThe road remains closed for
OL,18,Finvestigations and motorists are
OL,19,Fadvised to find alternative routes.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
