OL,3,GNEWSATeenage girl found in road with
OL,4,Acritical injuries
OL,5,
OL,6,FA police spokesperson said: "Inquiries
OL,7,Fare ongoing today as to how she came to
OL,8,Fsuffer these injuries, which include
OL,9,Fserious head and chest injuries, and
OL,10,Fanyone with information or footage
OL,11,Fwhich may assist this investigation
OL,12,Fshould contact us."
